sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SO as Sell Offer Service
    participant BAL as Balance Service
    participant DB as Balance DB

    Note over SO: Every state change is also emitted as an audit event, asynchronously and off the trade path

    Note over SO: PHASE 1 - TRANSACTION REQUESTED (sync REST, after the lock)
    SO->>BAL: Transaction requested (requestId as idempotency key, offer id, buyer account, seller account, price, margin)
    BAL->>DB: Find the records by requestId
    alt Records already exist
        DB-->>BAL: Existing result
        BAL-->>SO: Existing result
    else New request
        Note over BAL,DB: ONE database transaction, check and create are atomic per buyer account
        BAL->>DB: Buyer eligible balance = EXECUTED credits + EXECUTED and REQUESTED debits
        alt Not enough money
            BAL-->>SO: Rejected INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE
        else Enough money
            BAL->>DB: Insert REQUESTED records with expiration, source type offer, source id offer id: buyer debit (price + margin), seller credit (supplier price), platform fee credit (margin)
            BAL-->>SO: Accepted (expiration)
        end
    end

    Note over SO: PHASE 2 - VALIDATION IN SELL OFFER
    opt Validation failed
        SO->>BAL: Reject the records (requestId)
        BAL->>DB: All three records REQUESTED to REJECTED
        BAL-->>SO: Done
    end

    Note over SO,EXP: PHASE 3 - PAYMENT (async, outbox and CDC)
    SO->>SO: Insert the payment transaction in a new database transaction with its outbox row (timeout shorter than the record expiration)
    SO-)BAL: Payment transaction (outbox, CDC, Kafka)
    BAL->>BAL: Idempotent by event id
    Note over BAL,DB: ONE database transaction
    BAL->>DB: Read the three records of the request
    alt All records REQUESTED and not expired
        BAL->>DB: Records REQUESTED to EXECUTED
        BAL->>DB: Insert the exchange record (immutable Transaction)
        BAL->>DB: Insert outbox row ExchangeCompleted
        BAL-)SO: ExchangeCompleted (CDC)
    else Records expired or REJECTED
        BAL->>DB: Insert outbox row PaymentRejected (code)
        BAL-)SO: PaymentRejected (CDC)
    end

    Note over BAL: The buyer funds are free again by themselves. Sell Offer ends the request by its own sweeper